  "effects_note": "MuMain has no RenderPartObjectBody arm for MODEL_STINGER_BOW: drawn as its sheets. PartObjectColor2 gives it its Color (ZzzObject.cpp:6682). MU holds it at its own angle, (-60, 0, -80) off the hand (ZzzCharacter.cpp:6839-6845); not carried.",
  "held_clip": 1,
  "release": 0.714,
  "release_from": "Action 1, the draw, which MU plays on PLAYER_ATTACK_BOW (ZzzCharacter.cpp:10097-10100): Box01 (bone 43), the nock, runs -32, -40, -57, -74, -84 and snaps to -21 on key 5 of 7. 5/7.",
  "rig_note": "Bow24.rig.json from export-rig --actions=all: 45 bones, three actions of 8, 7 and 9 keys. MU plays action 0 always while held, at PLAYER_STOP_MALE's PlaySpeed, and action 1 in a shot; a bow here holds one clip, so it holds the draw (held_clip 1), and action 0's idle is not carried. No nocked arrow in the mesh, so no muzzle bone. Held sprites: ZzzCharacter.cpp:7972-7999 (fx/held_lights, to do).",
